        "content": [
          {
            "type": "title",
            "mainTi": "KALAM"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": [
              "Every year, Karpagam College of Engineering organizes “KALAM – In Search of Talents,” an intercollegiate Extracurricular Fest exclusively for freshmen. The vibrant festival provides a platform for students to showcase their <b>talents, creativity, sporting skills, and artistic</b> abilities while fostering healthy competition, teamwork, and camaraderie among participating institutions.",
              "The fest features a diverse range of events, including <b>Cricket, Kabaddi, Carving, Drawing & Painting, Rangoli, Facial Painting, Mehndi, Solo Dance, Group Dance, Rock Band, Fun Games, and DJ Night.</b> Through KALAM, students get an opportunity to explore their interests, discover their potential, build confidence, and celebrate creativity beyond the classroom."
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "split-image-content",
      "data": {
        "imagePosition": "left",
        "sectionbg": "section-bg3",
        "image": "/images/kce/campus-facilities/dhurva.webp",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "title",
            "mainTi": "DHRUVA"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": [
              "DHRUVA – <b>A National-Level Techno-Management-Cultural Fest</b> is organized every year in the month of February as a vibrant intercollegiate event that brings together students from institutions across the country. The fest features a wide spectrum of <b>Technical Workshops, Technical Competitions, Cultural Events, Fun Events, Entertainment Programmes, Game Zone, and various other engaging activities.</b>",
              " It provides students with opportunities to showcase their talents, creativity, technical expertise, and competitive spirit. With its diverse and exciting programmes, <b>DHRUVA attracts more than 5,000 students every year,</b> making it one of the major student-centric intercollegiate events of the institution."
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "items": [
              "100+ Technical Events",
              "50+ Workshops",
              "50+ Cultural Events",
              "20+ Traditional Events",
              "10+ Championship Events",
              "10+ Fun Events"
            ]
          }
        ]
